<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <NoWarn>1701;1702;NU1900</NoWarn>
    <PackageId>Copper68k</PackageId>
    <Title>Copper68k</Title>
    <Authors>Ilkka Lehtoranta</Authors>
    <Description>Reusable Motorola 68000-family CPU emulation core with cycle-aware interpreter backends and an opt-in MC68040 JIT.</Description>
    <Version>1.5.2</Version>
    <PackageVersion>1.5.2</PackageVersion>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>Adds CMPM.W/L and integer operand forms reached by native stock A1200 replays of UFO and Alien Breed 3D II, including sized arithmetic, logical and MOVE forms, SUBX.B/W, SUB.W An to Dn, MOVEM.W indirect, AND postincrement, OR/NEG/CMPA absolute-long, TST PC displacement, PC brief indexed ADDA and further indexed and PC-relative memory MOVE forms. Admitted MOVE, MOVEA, CLR, LEA, PEA, JMP and JSR forms implement full-format indexed addressing with base/index suppression, displacements and pre/post memory indirection; other combinations remain explicitly unsupported. MOVE.W (An)+,SR checks privilege and increments the old stack before switching modes. Focused tests cover pointer-read order, widths, signed and scaled indexes, stack aliases and complete return addresses, stack stride and condition codes. Adds sized predecrement CMP, absolute-word/postincrement MOVE in both directions, byte/word absolute-long to indirect MOVE, indirect EOR/OR, postincrement ADDI and byte absolute-long ADDQ and immediate byte ASL reached by 4th Dimension and Kick Off 3. Tests retain signed addresses, sized memory writes, arithmetic flags, A7 strides, read-modify-write barriers and the 040 fallback fetch buffer. Adds indexed address-register MOVE.W, PC/An indexed OR.B/W, sized absolute-word CLR/TST/SUBQ, PC indexed MOVE to absolute-word, absolute-word MOVEM.L stores, byte/word immediate MOVE, sized indirect/absolute-long immediate EOR and indirect immediate SUBI and absolute-word immediate BTST reached by the supplied Brian the Lion CD32 hard-disk rip. Adds sized address-displacement MOVE to absolute-word and postincrement MOVE to brief indexed destinations with source/base/index alias ordering and A7 byte strides. Adds ASR.W displacement memory with one arithmetic shift, condition codes and a read-modify-write barrier. Fixes byte/word Dn stores whose broad absolute-long decode also admitted absolute-word destinations and consumed the following opcode. Native game verification is ongoing. Advanced CPU timing retains an approximate policy. This source version is a development candidate until explicitly released.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/ilehtoranta/CopperMod</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/ilehtoranta/CopperMod.git</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild Condition="'$(GITHUB_ACTIONS)' == 'true'">true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
    <PackageTags>emulation;m68000;m68k;68000;68ec020;68020;68030;68040;68060;cpu;jit</PackageTags>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageIcon>copper68k-icon.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>false</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Debug|AnyCPU'">
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);1701;1702;NU1900</NoWarn>
    <Optimize>true</Optimize>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Release|AnyCPU'">
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);1701;1702;NU1900</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="copper68k-icon.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="HotPathGuard.Analyzers" Version="0.1.0" PrivateAssets="all" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub" Version="10.0.303" PrivateAssets="All" />
    <PackageReference Include="CopperFloat" Version="[1.0.0]" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
